e door stays open either way.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:26px 0 0 0;color:#2C2926">— Kody</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#2C2926;padding:32px 40px"><tbody><tr><td><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#4A453F;margin:0 0 24px 0"/><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#A09890;text-align:center">Patina — Furniture intelligence for design professionals</p><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#7A736C;text-align:center">Patina Inc. · 123 Design Way, Suite 100 · San Francisco, CA 94102</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>$html$, $html$["first_name"]$html$::jsonb, true),
