p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:0 0 18px 0;color:#4A453F">The deposit invoice is ready to send — a signed proposal fills it in for you. Purchase orders can go to the makers whenever you&#x27;re set. And the hours you&#x27;ve been logging are already sitting against this client, waiting for that first invoice.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:0 0 18px 0;color:#4A453F">None of it is urgent tonight. But when you&#x27;re ready, it&#x27;s all a short step from where the signature left off.</p><div style="margin:30px 0;text-align:center"><a href="{{app_url}}/desk" style="line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;border-radius:24px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;text-align:center;padding:14px 32px 14px 32px;min-height:48px;background-color:#C4A57B;color:#FFFFFF" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:21" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:10.5px">Open the document</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></div><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:26px 0 0 0;color:#2C2926">— Kody</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#2C2926;padding:32px 40px"><tbody><tr><td><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#4A453F;margin:0 0 24px 0"/><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#A09890;text-align:center">Patina — Furniture intelligence for design professionals</p><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#7A736C;text-align:center">Patina Inc. · 123 Design Way, Suite 100 · San Francisco, CA 94102</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>$html$, $html$["first_name","client_first_name"]$html$::jsonb, true),
