  </style></head><body style="background-color:#FAF7F2;font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0">Paid, recorded, reconciled — and the Pledge is now in motion.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#FFFFFF"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #C4A57B, #8B7355);padding:32px 40px;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:28px;line-height:24px;margin:0;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px">Patina</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:40px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:0 0 18px 0;color:#4A453F">{{first_name}}<!-- -->,</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:0 0 18px 0;color:#4A453F">A payment cleared. It&#x27;s recorded against the client, reconciled in Accounts, and sitting in your receivables as paid — nothing left for you to file.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:0 0 18px 0;color:#4A453F">This is also the moment the Pledge stops being a line in a welcome letter: a quarter of our commission goes back to the designers who teach the system — and what Patina earned on this payment is part of that promise.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:0 0 18px 0;color:#4A453F">First money through the books is a quiet milestone, but it&#x27;s the one the whole thing is built to reach. Well earned.</p><div style="margin:30px 0;text-align:center"><a href="{{app_url}}/desk?sheet=accounts" style="line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;border-radius:24px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;text-align:center;padding:14px 32px 14px 32px;min-height:48px;background-color:#C4A57B;color:#FFFFFF" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:21" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:10.5px">See it in Accounts</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></div><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:26px 0 0 0;color:#2C2926">— Kody</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#2C2926;padding:32px 40px"><tbody><tr><td><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#4A453F;margin:0 0 24px 0"/><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#A09890;text-align:center">Patina — Furniture intelligence for design professionals</p><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#7A736C;text-align:center">Patina Inc. · 123 Design Way, Suite 100 · San Francisco, CA 94102</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>$html$, $html$["first_name"]